he ability to mess with the Messengers as well. These theories aren't mutually exclusive either.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Lulu explicitly did not make the Imbued. Doesn't even know where they came from. Reference: ToJ Epilogue. Doesn't stop him from claiming responsibility though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T01:34:25-08:00","id":769038,"title":"","content":"I didn't say he made them, just that he claims to have (and there's plenty of reason to believe he has a point) been able to take advantage of their presence more directly than just having a bunch of monster-hunters around to steer at his enemies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}